{"id":"b5aa90b37d1feafa","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-cut-elimination.md","title":"Gentzen's Cut Elimination Theorem","display":"thm-cut-elimination — Gentzen's Cut Elimination Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-cut-elimination","aliases":["57-thm-cut-elimination"],"display":"thm-cut-elimination — Gentzen's Cut Elimination Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-cut-sequent]]","[[57-df-sc-derivable]]","[[57-df-fin-deriv-tree]]","[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-cut-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-cut-elimination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cut-elimination — Gentzen's Cut Elimination Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d12fd7171ee9182c\" href=\"?note=d12fd7171ee9182c\" title=\"57-df-cut-sequent\">57-df-cut-sequent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"177be28d1dd7c11d\" href=\"?note=177be28d1dd7c11d\" title=\"57-df-sc-derivable\">57-df-sc-derivable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d0789749a0d83f0d\" href=\"?note=d0789749a0d83f0d\" title=\"57-df-fin-deriv-tree\">57-df-fin-deriv-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"767b690e575dbfa5\" href=\"?note=767b690e575dbfa5\" title=\"57-df-SequentCalculus\">57-df-SequentCalculus</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Gentzen's-Cut-Elimination-Theorem\">Gentzen's Cut Elimination Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SC}=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}_{SC}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{SC}=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}_{SC}\\rangle\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"767b690e575dbfa5\" href=\"?note=767b690e575dbfa5\" title=\"57-df-SequentCalculus\">57-df-SequentCalculus</a>；该系统本身不含 CUT。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CUT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CUT}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d12fd7171ee9182c\" href=\"?note=d12fd7171ee9182c\" title=\"57-df-cut-sequent\">57-df-cut-sequent</a> 的切割关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d0789749a0d83f0d\" href=\"?note=d0789749a0d83f0d\" title=\"57-df-fin-deriv-tree\">57-df-fin-deriv-tree</a>。对本文件的扩展系统，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\Delta\\)</span> 表示根矢列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\)</span> 属于该系统的根集合。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SC}^{-\\mathrm{cut}}\">\\(\\mathrm{SC}^{-\\mathrm{cut}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SC}^{+\\mathrm{cut}}\">\\(\\mathrm{SC}^{+\\mathrm{cut}}\\)</span> 是下式定义的两个证明系统；上标中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cut}\">\\(\\mathrm{cut}\\)</span> 标识切割规则，前者为原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SC}\">\\(\\mathrm{SC}\\)</span>，后者在其规则模式中加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CUT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CUT}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SC}^{-\\mathrm{cut}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{SC},\\qquad\\mathrm{SC}^{+\\mathrm{cut}}\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}_{SC}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CUT}\\}\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SC}^{-\\mathrm{cut}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{SC},\\qquad\\mathrm{SC}^{+\\mathrm{cut}}\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}_{SC}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CUT}\\}\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\Delta\\leftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\in\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathcal P}\\quad(\\mathcal P\\in\\{\\mathrm{SC}^{-\\mathrm{cut}},\\mathrm{SC}^{+\\mathrm{cut}}\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\Delta\\leftrightarrow(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\in\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathcal P}\\quad(\\mathcal P\\in\\{\\mathrm{SC}^{-\\mathrm{cut}},\\mathrm{SC}^{+\\mathrm{cut}}\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}^{+\\mathrm{cut}}}\\Delta\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}^{-\\mathrm{cut}}}\\Delta,\\qquad\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\Delta\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}^{-\\mathrm{cut}}}\\Delta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}^{+\\mathrm{cut}}}\\Delta\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}^{-\\mathrm{cut}}}\\Delta,\\qquad\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\Delta\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}^{-\\mathrm{cut}}}\\Delta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原 SC 的无切割定义和原等价式，另把真正的切割可消去结论写在显式 SC+cut 扩张上。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Gentzen's-Cut-Elimination-Theorem","text":"Gentzen's Cut Elimination Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-d